    title: "Linker name lookups beyond WI-gopok's scope still admit a same-named symbol in any language (di_resolution nestjs, type_hierarchy method->class fallback, grpc Register*Server, decorator_dispatch, route_handler, @hg:dispatches)"  # 7182
